Author: Ricardo I Alcala Briseno [aut, cre], Adam Carson [ctb], 
        Yung-Hsiang Lan [ctb], Ebba Peterson [ctb], Niklaus J Grunwald [ctb], 
        Jared M LeBoldus [ctb]
Maintainer: Ricardo I Alcala Briseno <ria5282@psu.edu>
Description: hoboR provides functions to process CSV files generated by HOBO 
             weather station. The package automatically imports multiple HOBO 
             data records, removes multiple duplicate records, identifies 
             impossible values, subset time ranges and summarize environmental 
             data.
